      "type": "single",
      "category": "cs_net",
      "subCategory": "cs_net",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "content": "某主机地址为 192.168.10.130/26，该地址所在子网的网络地址是（ ）。",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "content": "192.168.10.128" },
        { "key": "B", "content": "192.168.10.64" },
        { "key": "C", "content": "192.168.10.192" },
        { "key": "D", "content": "192.168.10.0" }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "analysis": "/26 的掩码是 255.255.255.192，块大小 64，子网边界为 0、64、128、192。130 落在 128～191 之间，故网络地址为 192.168.10.128，可用主机 126 个。"
    },
    {
