      "category": "cs_net",
      "subCategory": "cs_net",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "下列路由协议中，属于链路状态路由协议的是（ ）。",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "content": "RIP" },
        { "key": "B", "content": "OSPF" },
        { "key": "C", "content": "BGP" },
        { "key": "D", "content": "RIPv2" }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "analysis": "OSPF 采用链路状态算法，通过洪泛 LSA 建立链路状态数据库，再用 SPF（Dijkstra）计算最短路径；RIP、RIPv2 属于距离矢量协议；BGP 属于路径矢量协议。"
    },
    {
