      "subCategory": "cs_net",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "BGP 建立邻居关系时使用的传输层端口号是（ ）。",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "content": "179" },
        { "key": "B", "content": "21" },
        { "key": "C", "content": "53" },
        { "key": "D", "content": "520" }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "analysis": "BGP 运行在 TCP 之上，使用 179 端口建立可靠的对等体连接。21 是 FTP 控制端口，53 是 DNS，520 是 RIP。"
    },
